Table full name: GLOBAL_GOVERNMENT.CYBERSYN.INTERNATIONAL_TRADE_ADMINISTRATION_EXPORT_SCREENED_ENTITIES_INDEX
Column name: CITIZENSHIPS Type: ARRAY Description: Citizenships of the listed individual.
Column name: SOURCE_INFORMATION_URL Type: TEXT Description: URL for the source.
Column name: ADDRESSES Type: ARRAY Description: The physical addresses associated with the entity.
Column name: SOURCE Type: TEXT Description: Name of the source that identified and monitors this company, entity, or person.
Column name: END_DATE Type: DATE Description: The date when the listing will no longer be valid.
Column name: PROGRAMS Type: ARRAY Description: Specific sanction or restriction program under which the individual, entity, or vessel is listed.
Column name: DATES_OF_BIRTH Type: ARRAY Description: Birth dates of the listed individual(s), if available.
Column name: VESSEL_GROSS_TONNAGE Type: TEXT Description: A more modern measurement of a ship's size that is calculated based on the volume of all enclosed spaces of a ship.
Column name: FEDERAL_REGISTER_NOTICE Type: TEXT Description: The Federal Register citation indicating the law or policy under which the entity is listed.
Column name: EXPORT_RESTRICTED_ENTITY_TYPE Type: TEXT Description: The type of entity that is listed (e.g., Vessel, Individual, Entity, Aircraft).
Column name: COMMENTS Type: TEXT Description: Associated comments from the organization on the entity.
Column name: EXPORT_RESTRICTED_ENTITY_NUMBER Type: NUMBER Description: Unique identifier for the entity.
Column name: VESSEL_CALL_SIGN Type: TEXT Description: The unique call sign assigned to a vessel for identification purposes, similar to a license plate number on a vehicle.
Column name: ALT_NAMES Type: ARRAY Description: Any known alternate names for the entity.
Column name: START_DATE Type: DATE Description: The date when the listing came into effect.
Column name: GEO_ID_COUNTRY Type: TEXT Description: Unique geographic identifier for the country associated with the listing.
Column name: SOURCE_LIST_URL Type: TEXT Description: URL for the source list or further information about the entry.
Column name: NATIONALITIES Type: ARRAY Description: Nationality of the listed individual or entity's country of formation.
Column name: EXPORT_RESTRICTED_ENTITY_NAME Type: TEXT Description: The name of the individual, group, vessel, or entity on the list (e.g., Khokhlova, Olga Nikolayevna).
Column name: VESSEL_GROSS_REGISTERED_TONNAGE Type: TEXT Description: A measure of the overall internal volume of a vessel, with one gross registered tonnage unit representing 100 cubic feet of space.
Column name: EXPORT_RESTRICTED_ENTITY_ID Type: TEXT Description: Unique identifier provided by the International Trade Administration (ITA) for the entity listed with a prefix associated with the source.
Column name: EXPORT_RESTRICTED_ENTITY_TITLE Type: TEXT Description: The title for an individual, group, vessel, or entity on the list (e.g., Member of the Federation Council of the Federal Assembly of the Russian Federation).
Column name: IDS Type: ARRAY Description: Associated IDs with an individual or group (e.g., passport details).
Column name: PLACES_OF_BIRTH Type: ARRAY Description: Place of birth of the listed individual(s), if available.
